"Vice Presidents"},{"id":"B198-112","when":"April 1979","p":55,"h":"Past Presidents / Life Members / Vice Presidents"}],"photos":[{"f":"crops/B229/B229-p08-walk-match-battersea-1938.jpg","c":"The caption that goes with this photograph in our archives reads:\n\"Walk Match at Battersea circa 1938. Starters include H.G. Churcher, C.E.Churcher, D.E. Brown, A.A.Harley, F. Jarvis, C.W.Redgrave.\"\nOur first stab at actually naming the faces came up with Don Brown (1), Harry Churcher (7), Charlie Churcher (23), C.W. Redgrave (24) and Alf Harley (behind Brown). However, as others have become involved and have cast their eyes over the picture, we are now not at all sure of anyone except Alf Harley. For instance, we are told that Charlie Churcher did not wear glasses and the chap next to Harry, second from the left, may be Jack Rutland If any reader can help us with more specific details of the race then we would be very pleased to hear from them.","id":"B229-16","w":"February 2001"}],"photo":{"file":"crops/B229/B229-p08-walk-match-battersea-1938.jpg","caption":"The caption that goes with this photograph in our archives reads:\n\"Walk Match at Battersea circa 1938. Starters include H.G. Churcher, C.E.Churcher, D.E. Brown, A.A.Harley, F. Jarvis, C.W.Redgrave.\"\nOur first stab at actually naming the faces came up with Don Brown (1), Harry Churcher (7), Charlie Churcher (23), C.W. Redgrave (24) and Alf Harley (behind Brown). However, as others have become involved and have cast their eyes over the picture, we are now not at all sure of anyone except Alf Harley. For instance, we are told that Charlie Churcher did not wear glasses and the chap next to Harry, second from the left, may be Jack Rutland If any reader can help us with more specific details of the race then we would be very pleased to hear from them.","source":"B229-16","when":"February 2001"},"x":1,"share":{"d":"Don Brown in The Belgravian, the Belgrave Harriers club gazette, 1931–2001: 142 mentions in 67 issues, 62 race results and 1 photograph. Wrote or reported 1 item.","img":"https://belgravian-images.stephendgardner.workers.dev/belgravian/crops/B229/B229-p08-walk-match-battersea-1938.jpg","u":"https://stephengardner1.github.io/belgrave-harriers-data/belgravian/read/share/p-don-brown.html"},"legend":false}